     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Aspect in the future",
     "texto": [
      "The imperfective forms the compound future with **będę + infinitive**: **będę czytać** («I will be reading» / «I will read»).",
      "The perfective has a simple future: **przeczytam** («I will read it through»). The prefix can change the aspect and the nuance."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
